(the ad plays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the content player so it reaches the layer system picture-in-picture is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presenting) and has to give it back afterwards. Only the adapter knows what to give","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"back, and it must read that from the PLAYER rather than remember what was passed to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"load(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": integrators legitimately call ","type":"text"},{"code":"replaceCurrentItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" themselves — the demo","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does — so an adapter tracking only its own calls would report the wrong asset, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An adapter that cannot answer returns nil and simply does not get shared-element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insertion; ","type":"text"},{"code":"DA-SHARED-ELEMENT-UNSUPPORTED","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" explains why.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore/PlayerAdapter/sourceUrl":{"abstract":[{"text":"Optional: the URL this adapter is currently playing — the ASSET, not a surface.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sourceUrl"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"defaultImplementations":1,"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter\/sourceUrl","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/playeradapter\/sourceurl","title":"sourceUrl","required":true,"role":"symbol"},"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCo